          "kicker": "Stat watch",
          "heading": "Fiji seek to improve performance following November 2025 defeat against France",
          "body": "Fiji look to reverse their form in the upcoming Round four fixture against France. In their last meeting with Les Bleus, which took place in November 2025 during an international friendly, Fiji suffered a 34-21 away defeat. The Flying Fijians currently sit 12th in the 12-team Nations Championship table, having failed to secure a victory in their opening three matches. Their Round three fixture ended in a 17-33 defeat against Scotland. Across these three tournament appearances, Fiji have scored 49 points. They have also conceded 145 points."
