          "heading": "France national team secure 54-12 away victory against Wales in February",
          "body": "The France national team recorded their largest margin of victory in their last 11 matches during the 2026 Six Nations. The side defeated Wales 54-12 in an away fixture in February 2026, marking the highest points total achieved in the current window. Across these 11 games, France have scored a total of 426 points and conceded 291. This represents an average of 38.7 points scored and 26.5 points conceded per match."
