          "heading": "Ireland Women back row Aoife Wafer ruled out of Japan fixture",
          "body": "Aoife Wafer is ruled out of Sunday's Ireland Women fixture against Japan in Galway after sustaining a minor injury during training. Head coach Scott Bemand has responded by making six changes to the starting XV following a loss to the United States. Brittany Hogan joins the back row, while Eilís Cahill earns her first international start. Bemand noted that the encounter offers an \"ideal opportunity\" to develop the squad's attacking prowess during this World Cup cycle."
