          "body": "Italy Men currently sit 11th in the Nations Championship table after three rounds of competition. The side has conceded 131 points across their opening fixtures, leaving them with a points difference of -94. This total was heavily impacted by a 10-57 away loss to Australia in July 2026. That result marked a fourth consecutive defeat for Gonzalo Quesada's team, who have secured one victory in their last five international outings."
