          "body": "Scotland Women host Australia this afternoon aiming to recover from successive WXV defeats against Canada and New Zealand. While the hosts have recorded 40 points across their opening two fixtures, they remain winless heading into the final match of the first Global Series block at the Edinburgh Rugby Stadium. Australia are also searching for their first win of the campaign, having struggled through the opening weeks. The match will be available to stream via BBC iPlayer as Scotland seek to conclude their home fixtures with a victory."
