          "heading": "Lukhan Salakaia-Loto replaces injured Josh Canham for South Africa Test match",
          "body": "Australia have been forced into a late pack reshuffle after lock Josh Canham was ruled out of the Perth Test with a hamstring injury. Head coach Les Kiss has promoted Lukhan Salakaia-Loto to the starting XV to replace the lineout caller, with Lachlan Shaw joining the replacements. Captain Harry Wilson noted that Salakaia-Loto’s physicality will be vital against a world champion side that has made 13 changes, as the Wallabies look to sustain their recent form under the new coaching regime."
