          "body": "The Japan Women's national side aim to overcome a seven-place ranking deficit when they face Ireland at Dexcom Stadium this weekend. Following a period where the team has struggled for form, the Japanese must counter an Irish side bolstered by six personnel changes. Ireland head coach Scott Bemand noted Japan’s \"certain style\" as a specific challenge, while tactical analysis suggests the visitors must prioritise a disciplined opening 40 minutes to neutralise the hosts’ proven early-game potency."
